9ec", "type": "concept", "title": "seating choices"}, {"id": "683e348c-2aa4-4ade-96a8-6eb0874aa1b8", "type": "concept", "title": "visual supports"}, {"id": "2a06209e-8be9-4baf-9b31-99e756c0a417", "type": "concept", "title": "digital norms"}], "description": "Students arrange space and tools to support safety, independence, and collaboration."}, {"id": "994c63dd-4148-484f-a175-b83c1812ee3e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Beginning-of-year launch", "children": [{"id": "ef8984b7-231c-43c5-a269-041b82ff3c29", "type": "concept", "title": "practice cycles"}, {"id": "9e5a38c3-7678-4d52-ba80-2d7e19508ff0", "type": "concept", "title": "modeling"}, {"id": "7046ddd6-dc2b-4e29-a154-c2e7b1fbb1c6", "type": "concept", "title": "rehearsal"}, {"id": "79119f13-c086-4736-b884-b3d18dfba036", "type": "concept", "title": "reteaching"}], "description": "Students plan the first days and weeks as a deliberate culture-building sequence."}]}, {"id": "833870e3-b4ca-41d8-92c5-43da439a9065", "type": "topic", "title": "Rules, Expectations, Norms, and Accountability", "description": "This unit helps students distinguish rule lists from shared norms, clear expectations, and fair accountability systems.", "children": [{"id": "324bd291-754a-4f9a-afdf-51de5b504d63", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Expectations and agreements", "children": [{"id": "bcf24e58-dc58-408c-af11-f143ee2c0f84", "type": "concept", "title": "few and memorable expectations"}, {"id": "52b87d4d-fddb-40dc-a7fb-02d86a292bf0", "type": "concept", "title": "student-generated norms"}, {"id": "854031c4-a8a0-4401-b5d0-35f6523424c2", "type": "concept", "title": "behavior examples"}, {"id": "b73161d1-c95a-4d80-9493-43d714ec9bd9", "type": "concept", "title": "nonexamples"}], "description": "Students learn to write positive, observable, teachable expectations."}, {"id": "e736ea5d-0208-4419-8023-657c707e4dfd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Consistency and fairness", "children": [{"id": "5af6c2d7-6cf7-454d-8297-bca60bacc8a8", "type": "concept", "title": "logical consequences"}, {"id": "6d9499c3-7579-4d92-84f1-39d2c296f758", "type": "concept", "title": "equity checks"}, {"id": "3b322654-f9a3-4ae0-a0a5-1522d2c34a73", "type": "concept", "title": "documentation"}, {"id": "76ffb971-f8b4-40fb-92f8-24d73c51b719", "type": "concept", "title": "restorative accountability"}], "description": "Students practice responding consistently while still considering context and student needs."}, {"id": "5c6e9c3d-7623-491c-8225-328f18337483", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Accountability systems", "children": [{"id": "08ac4bff-cfeb-4afc-b63f-bc977903a41f", "type": "concept", "title": "token systems"}, {"id": "70c13e1c-d3bc-430a-ab33-7d4fa3d6e9cf", "type": "concept", "title": "class points"}, {"id": "078bf9e3-ac08-4029-9daf-272721286932", "type": "concept", "title": "public charts cautions"}, {"id": "598e5024-e169-4d8f-9682-79a44892f871", "type": "concept", "title": "private feedback"}], "description": "Students learn how individual, group, and class accountability systems can help or harm."}]}, {"id": "e60b1155-ca58-4379-be70-38a9a5e6050f", "type": "topic", "title": "Positive Behavior Support, PBIS, and MTSS", "description": "PBIS and MTSS give teachers a system for matching supports to student needs instead of relying on one-size-fits-all discipline.", "children": [{"id": "d32bdc9e-0ddd-4636-80b0-e797cb1dbaac", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Tier 1 classroom supports", "children": [{"id": "438685eb-0f9f-464f-830a-1b50d0e36900", "type": "concept", "title": "explicit expectations"}, {"id": "a1de166e-6be7-4e95-be27-e82d8831ec1d", "type": "concept", "title": "active supervision"}, {"id": "d57e5c84-a465-4f4b-90ea-6c5e45cf686e", "type": "concept", "title": "behavior-specific praise"}, {"id": "c049a19f-140c-4b73-9640-e3df4307c546", "type": "concept", "title": "precorrection"}], "description": "Students learn universal practices that support most students."}, {"id": "db029094-066c-4734-b9de-4889e7078d8f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Tier 2 and Tier 3 supports", "children": [{"id": "b1a81b7b-593a-4c25-bb75-2f73e297e6e5", "type": "concept", "title": "check-in/check-out"}, {"id": "8e1a8088-1dcf-4963-a0d2-f0c7e730d37f", "type": "concept", "title": "behavior contracts"}, {"id": "b20e3f65-2fed-4ce0-881f-6613039dab98", "type": "concept", "title": "functional behavior assessment"}, {"id": "4bce1f0e-e820-400e-a1c2-2bded356c0fc", "type": "concept", "title": "behavior intervention plan"}], "description": "Students learn when additional supports are needed and how to coordinate them."}, {"id": "7eadc22e-18c9-4e5b-b484-2d88c9e7f8a0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Using behavior data", "children": [{"id": "9087f907-5b7b-44a8-b8d4-974d84509a62", "type": "concept", "title": "frequency data"}, {"id": "e2c945a3-620b-45fd-8177-0daaca9c240c", "type": "concept", "title": "ABC notes"}, {"id": "d66ca7f7-a505-4f1b-8420-1eca0a985228", "type": "concept", "title": "office referral data"}, {"id": "82faa6f3-d763-40ea-bb18-90cbee09c7d9", "type": "concept", "title": "progress monitoring"}], "description": "Students use patterns rather than impressions to guide decisions."}]}, {"id": "7724cae0-de87-465a-8567-20a593ef56d0", "type": "topic", "title": "Engagement, Instructional Design, and Active Learning", "description": "Many management problems are instruction problems in disguise, so engagement and lesson design are core management tools.", "children": [{"id": "c8efadaf-1729-4709-9f60-62055f61d611", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lesson clarity and pacing", "children": [{"id": "58f41333-f449-431c-b813-b922e3167cac", "type": "concept", "title": "learning targets"}, {"id": "4a2c3b0a-9d93-4292-9003-d2b0d147f635", "type": "concept", "title": "modeling"}, {"id": "06b2b044-3a09-48a1-ad24-ff61c39f3ac2", "type": "concept", "title": "chunking"}, {"id": "1dbd1cd3-2a83-4ae6-89ec-9ffb3a47f7fb", "type": "concept", "title": "checks for understanding"}], "description": "Students learn to reduce downtime, confusion, and transition friction."}, 